", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210884_988670664993027_3401519494358859447_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6Yzuc6FOOU0Q7kNvwHYwvtj&_nc_oc=Ado8y1ncvvlOpRQVyWEepHnliluCXKgAlEvRl-dx3wWvWTjoBAsJS8-yGAxuUU76aBU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTX_7DpuarhIxyVX7OwePD6-nMb6PhEYHZxT175bf8oDA&oe=6B031F87"}, {"file_name": "delete me 1 .png", "id": "172355680988904", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974479_172355684322237_4105130526410975147_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X6Y2kZF7usgQ7kNvwGUL4w0&_nc_oc=AdoEacTfDhFmaMYyCDrphdbDILq7m7dtuy964bEyu0BP5Qbq8h1tq16lgKnIFgnMmmo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR5Rwv8-iZX2Bml5hjdHNxX1kWNpxrS-8pJqrsemvKchg&oe=6B030699"}, {"file_name": "delete me 4.png", "id": "158877452514842", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75422392_158877455848175_4048704126648886678_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fyb07TAa3z4Q7kNvwHY4ZDS&_nc_oc=Adr5QXel1dZP_s8QIqLi18_v4V2NhFYzlsXupKUj0v1Fz_Qk1_3mh7qglcEUPcjA9vY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRXJ5BhwQmVp2PQRgue_XIEJbvmctiyKMWCLbnP9vhSWg&oe=6B030C0B"}, {"file_name": "delete me.png", "id": "138116401478547", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75462963_138116404811880_7726014392190288933_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NkMUfPZZO6UQ7kNvwHnE9eg&_nc_oc=Adr0GjtMy7Crouiih1ILGcpLasGczM-A09PydgGTke37bAcNsNulD6m0kqK3LZf_9eM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ59kU05mzd19kxjNw_julzCqBsARlevGhSxBJWvRuvjA&oe=6B03121E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "delette me 6.png", "id": "462900904730118", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570311_462900908063451_1017078218521890310_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RjM4I6NtHGIQ7kNvwGBBbDv&_nc_oc=Adpkj8WQk-WdZvYOCIkO4EpmYHcE4bh0U62-d20Uq5KWvO3ichiOVd5KICwSzlIM4eg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR7pmBhhKAqORTu8aYdqiOcqcoFmgtBN0GmjGKMKS7uCg&oe=6B0321E5"}, "display_name": "Healium", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Beautiful, nature-based escapes powered by your imagination. Float through a crystal forest, feel a healing rain wash over you, or sit quietly in a field of sunflowers. Virtually travel to Mauii, listen to the rustle of a bamboo forest and the ocean waves lapping at your feet. Experience different colors of healing, trace a mandalynth, or glide through a breath-taking fractal. Use your feelings of focused calm to make the flurries fly inside a magic snow globe. Sit quietly inside a zen garden. Grow leaves on a 150-year-old Burr Oak tree with your memories of being still. Healium is a walk in the park for those times when you can't physically take a walk in the park. In four peer-reviewed journals, Healium has been shown to improve mood in as little as four minutes. Connect an optional EEG meditation headband to make a firefly rise and fall with your feelings. Healium is a reminder that our thoughts have power to control things not only in the virtual world but the real world as well.", "short_description": "Beautiful, nature-based escapes powered by your imagination.  Float through a crystal forest, feel a healing rain wash over you, or sit quietly in a field of sunflowers. Virtually travel to Mauii, listen to the rustle of a bamboo forest and the ocean waves lapping at your feet. Experience different colors of healing, trace a mandalynth, or glide through a breath-taking fractal. Healium is a walk in the park for those times when you can't physically take a walk in the park. "}]}, "developer_name": "Healium", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.tryhealium.com/privacy-policy/", "devel